{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/1902bdd67e08ca17bd96296aa91ea0de.webp?t=1773788664\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different <strong>classes</strong> and <strong>spells</strong> to interact with the <strong>environment</strong> and overcome <strong>obstacles</strong> and <strong>monsters</strong> in unique ways. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignite oil puddles? Electrify water? Polymorph a <strong>GHOUL</strong> into a <strong>RAT</strong>? Or just cast silent step and sneak through the bunker in total <strong>stealth</strong> - it all depends on your skill and will. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>class</strong> has its own <strong>passives</strong> and <strong>spells.</strong> Find the perfect synergy, or form a full priest squad to bring <strong>TRUE FAITH</strong> into the bunker. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/c06d0d9363d95df48ab89c13a126cfac.poster.avif?t=1773788664\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/c06d0d9363d95df48ab89c13a126cfac.webm?t=1773788664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/ba8e06055f2ab4ea79b8b75dd590be6f.webp?t=1773788664\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casting <strong>spells</strong> will consume your <strong>FAITH</strong>, which causes you to be in <strong>FEAR.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some <strong>eldritch horrors</strong> can drain your <strong>FAITH</strong> as well, and if you fail to keep it steady, <strong>SHE</strong> will come for you. Then you will become a <strong>GHOUL</strong>... or something worse. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce your <strong>FEAR</strong> with alcohol or ally spells, keep the generator lights on, and buy some <strong>COPIUM</strong> during the mission. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/960619bf54f5921107fda9909465028e.poster.avif?t=1773788664\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/960619bf54f5921107fda9909465028e.webm?t=1773788664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/a4223ae596c9d9495c00352725ce37fc.webp?t=1773788664\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slowly open</strong> doors to check for traps, or <strong>kick</strong> them open during a chase. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every gameplay item is physical - grab it, throw it, or use it directly from your hands. You can even throw away a <strong>grenade</strong> triggered by a <strong>tripwire</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your teammates can <strong>catch</strong> items mid-air, <strong>BUT DON'T TOSS THEM AN ACTIVE GRENADE!</strong> It tends to separate the team. <strong>BY LIMBS</strong>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/ebb881cdc984a376040648577e506984.poster.avif?t=1773788664\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/ebb881cdc984a376040648577e506984.webm?t=1773788664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/8eefb4e27b91736238180e60be5c43d0.webp?t=1773788664\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel the light to keep <strong>FEAR</strong> away, or embrace the <strong>DARK</strong> for greater gain. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the generator is active, it restores your <strong>FAITH</strong> and slightly tames the monsters - but <strong>blocks paths</strong> filled with valuable <strong>loot</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>action</strong> leaves a mark. Defeating surface <strong>BOSSES</strong> or completing <strong>quests</strong> can alter the map - not always for the better. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/760e5d33837179d30976860817e5fa88.poster.avif?t=1773788664\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/760e5d33837179d30976860817e5fa88.webm?t=1773788664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/34806806e905c857d0f2cd15e6045231.webp?t=1773788664\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an alternate World War II era setting, where dieselpunk technology and eldritch horrors collide. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not <strong>FEAR</strong> Unreal Engine 5. We kept our <strong>FAITH</strong> and did our best to optimize it. Any lag is pure <strong>HERESY</strong> or simply the work of <strong>Empire</strong> enemies. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/2a0db6292bb99e8db53c640bf8f17876.poster.avif?t=1773788664\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/2a0db6292bb99e8db53c640bf8f17876.webm?t=1773788664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3312250?t=1773788664","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773788664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/106d3a0d206c5a696abd5eae016cec1b00698e2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773788664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/106d3a0d206c5a696abd5eae016cec1b00698e2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773788664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Monsters, guns, traps, dark locations, corpses, alcohol, dystopian world"},"det